  "label": "under prefer-remote, a listing carrying another body at the revision the base holds, over a local edit, pulls it and keeps the edit it drops",
  "note": "the store of 238 under prefer-remote. The carried c3 at r1, the base's own revision, is a remote edit, so prefer-remote settles a both-changed case: the item and the base take c3 at r1, its summary and sort key, reported ContentChanged, and the local edit c2, a body the base never held, is kept as a retained item under the key minted over the handle, reported Overruled. The base revision does not move: what tells this pull from a local edit is the base's body (SYNC.md sections 5 and 9; vector 14 the same case at a moved revision)",
